===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|en|fortnith||dialectal, obsolete}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|fourtenyght}}, {{m|enm|fourtene nyght}}, from {{inh|en|ang|[[fēowertīene]] [[niht]]}} (literally “fourteen nights"; the Anglo-Saxons counted by nights), equivalent to {{compound|en|fourteen|night|nocat=1}}. Compare {{m|en|sennight}}.

